ser-facing rationale, complete findings, evidence and limitations without exposing an internal model trace.</p><div class="filter-row"><span class="pill">Domain component</span><span class="pill">React</span><span class="pill">Validated data</span></div><section class="preview-shell" aria-label="ReasoningSummary preview"><div class="mcpcn-stack"><label class="mcpcn-label">Preview theme<select aria-label="Preview theme"><option value="light" selected="">Light</option><option value="dark">Dark</option></select></label><div data-preview-theme="light"><section aria-label="ReasoningSummary demonstration" class="mcpcn-stack"><p>Read the supplied report and request review. Requests only update this authored demonstration.</p><label>Report state <select aria-label="Decision report state"><option value="ready" selected="">Ready</option><option value="loading">Loading</option><option value="empty">Empty</option><option value="error">Error</option></select></label><label>Request response <select aria-label="Decision request response"><option value="immediate" selected="">Immediate</option><option value="hold">Hold until settled</option><option value="throw">Throw current request</option></select></label><div class="mcpcn-row"><label><input type="checkbox" checked=""/>Callback enabled</label><label><input type="checkbox"/>External busy</label><label><input type="checkbox" checked=""/>Mount component</label><label><input type="checkbox"/>Malformed data</label><label><input type="checkbox" checked=""/>Action available</label></div><div class="mcpcn-row"><button type="button">Replace report revision</button><button type="button">Replace callback</button><button type="button">Remove supplied confidence</button><button type="button">Remove supplied action</button><button type="button" disabled="">Resolve oldest request</button><button type="button" disabled="">Reject oldest request</button></div><section class="mcpcn mcpcn-card mcpcn-dn" role="region" aria-label="Authored user-facin