&lt;ReasoningSummary {...data} onAction={intent =&gt; console.log(intent)} /&gt;</pre><p><code>className</code> styles the surface and <code>onAction</code> receives consumer-owned intent. The new domain controls and revised approval/form surfaces expose <code>busy</code> and <code>error</code> feedback. Controlled selections and answers must be acknowledged by updating their props.</p><h2>Events</h2><p>This surface displays data and has no dedicated domain event contract.</p><h2>JSON Schema</h2><pre class="code" aria-label="ReasoningSummary JSON Schema">{
  &quot;$schema&quot;: &quot;https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema&quot;,
  &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Consumer-supplied user-facing rationale, findings, evidence and limitations; not an internal model trace or evidence verification.&quot;,
  &quot;oneOf&quot;: [
    {
      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;object&quot;,
      &quot;properties&quot;: {
        &quot;id&quot;: {
          &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,
          &quot;pattern&quot;: &quot;^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._:-]{0,127}$&quot;
        },
        &quot;revision&quot;: {
          &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,
          &quot;pattern&quot;: &quot;^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._:-]{0,127}$&quot;
        },
        &quot;title&quot;: {
          &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,
          &quot;maxLength&quot;: 300
        },
        &quot;description&quot;: {
          &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,
          &quot;maxLength&quot;: 4000
        },
        &quot;state&quot;: {
          &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,
          &quot;const&quot;: &quot;ready&quot;
        },
        &quot;summary&quot;: {
          &quot;type&quot;: &quot;object&quot;,
